<title>ESTONIA: Estonia Q3 GDP rose 4.5 pct - official.</title>
<headline>Estonia Q3 GDP rose 4.5 pct - official.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 4.5 percent in the third quarter of 1996 compared with the third quarter of 1995, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Total GDP for the third quarter was 13.6 billion kroons which was a rise of 100 million kroons from the second quarter, a statistics office spokesman told a news conference.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN GDP		     Q3 '96    Q2 '96    Q3 '95</p>
<p> GDP Change (pct) yr-on-yr     4.5	 4.2	n/a</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
